  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You have a connection between those of your kin who share the same scales as you whether you are friend or foe. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.1xRFPTFtWtGJ9ELw]{Sense Motive} checks against draconic creatures, and increase your circumstance bonus to checks to Request or Make an Impression against draconic, spiritual or elemental denizens affiliated with your Benefactor’s Domains, Aspects and Themes to a +2.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Against draconic creatures who have the same type of Benefactor as you, when you critically fail to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.OX4fy22hQgUHDr0q]{Make an Impression} or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.DCb62iCBrJXy0Ik6]{Request} against them their attitude towards you does not decrease, and if you critically fail to Sense their Motives, you do not get a false sense of their intentions.</span></p>"
    },
